#@MNX-FLOW id=post-acceptance-continuation kind=transaction title="Accepted switch to source-declared bounded continuation" source="exact tested closure, committed office record, post-commit seal, and # MNX_POST_ACCEPTANCE_PLAN" destination="one manifested continuation receipt plus next-stage evidence without rollback of the accepted system" defs='environment.etc."monsternix/bin/mnx-switch",environment.etc."monsternix/bin/mnx",environment.etc."monsternix/bin/mnx-upgrade",environment.etc."monsternix/bin/mnx-source-lexer"' programs="mnx-switch,mnx,mnx-upgrade" lock="mnx switch/test/storage locks released before continuation; action-owned locks acquired afterward" state="/var/lib/monsternix/post-acceptance,/var/lib/logbook/support/mnx-switch-*.post-acceptance.log" notes="The operator uses the explicit mnx test then mnx switch phases; mnx apply is optional compatibility machinery, not the handoff. Core acceptance commits and seals first; continuation failure is recorded as Stage-next input and never rewrites the accepted profile, baseline, or office."
