#@MNX-FLOW id=substrate-neutral-reconstruction-packet kind=portability title="Accepted Monsternix meaning to verified substrate-neutral reconstruction curriculum" source="exact accepted source, switch-committed office, behavior/evidence contracts, explicit NixOS adapter inventory, and bounded local backup-soak state" destination="verified RECONSTRUCTION-CONTRACT.json, RECONSTRUCTION-GUIDE.md, and RESTIC-BTRFS-SOAK.json inside every accepted Cloudtainer packet" defs='environment.etc."monsternix/bin/mnx-refactor",environment.etc."monsternix/bin/mnx",environment.etc."monsternix/bin/mnx-office",environment.etc."monsternix/bin/mnx-behavior-manifest",systemd.timers.m16-backup-m21,systemd.timers.m16-restic-maintenance,systemd.timers.m21-btrfs-pull-backup' programs="mnx-refactor,mnx,mnx-office,mnx-behavior-manifest" lock=none state="verified cloudtainer packet only; local source-owned public state is observed read-only" notes="The curriculum distinguishes portable contracts from current adapter bindings, names reconstruction order and required migration witnesses, runs no source or backup, reads no secret, and never claims the present Nix source executes elsewhere."
