    Opt in to a raw rsync tail only for targeted mirror debugging:

      MNX_SUPPORT_RAW_RSYNC=1 mnx support

    Transaction-scoped PID 1 manager-loop evidence:

      mnx loops
      mnx loops full

    Source and generated-unit audit:

