      mnx source-audit
      mnx-configuration-as-bash audit

    `mnx test` saves the full rebuild transcript below /var/lib/logbook/support. It holds the shared
    storage-maintenance lock, directly writes no backup filesystem, and restores the exact prior running
    closure by default if activation or postflight fails.
  '';

