              'This directory is disposable and non-authoritative. `accepted.nix` is an exact read-only baseline;',
              '`WORKSPACE-SHA256SUMS` binds every static file while deliberately excluding editable `candidate.nix`;',
              '`candidate.nix` is the only editable complete proposal. Nothing here edits `/etc/nixos/configuration.nix`.',
              "",
              'Suggested loop:',
              "",
